==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*stahlą}}, {{m|gem-pro|*stahliją}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*stak-||to stay, be firm}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|staal}}, Danish {{m|da|stål}}, Icelandic {{m|is|stál}}, also English {{m|en|steel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃtaːl/|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|aːl|lang=de}}

===Noun===
